 whether a  global emergency was declared weeks ago  sorry I didn't answer one question  it is rights and fair for me to ask  whether a global emergency was declared  weeks ago by the World Health  Organization it's quite right for you to  ask questions but the question here is  really important is the government doing  the right thing is it trying desperately  quite rightly to obtain PPE equipment is  it trying to support our frontline staff  yes the answer those questions are yes  but is every other country doing exactly  the same yes that is the problem this  pandemic is on unprecedented scale and  every country is in exactly the same  place trying to get the same equipment  from the same suppliers this is the key  problem in Italy in Spain in France  Germany and in America every country is  in the same boat so what I'm asking is  we get a bit of context on this and  understand that the information about  this should have been out much earlier  much earlier than just the end of  January should have been out in December  when the real data was known that this  was a serious problem and was spreading  but if by late February scientists were  warning policymakers that of the UK  conserve the 380 thousand deaths without  urgent intervention is fair to ask  whether the government's could have  addressed this more aggressively and  also whether the government should have  been sending PPE to China again let's  put this in context the government it  was all the advice that was given to  them by the medical professionals and by  the scientists they have followed  exactly to the letter that is critical  now the whole point about this PPE point  get there again in context at the time  we were understanding that China was  getting under control on this issue and  therefore support from many other  countries not just the UK to try and  help China contain this we did not know  at the time that the data on this was  far more extensive and should have been  released but however that was trying to  contain it in China not let it spread it  turns out because people were still  moving out of China that that had  already began to spread  that was known this government other  governments in France and all these  other countries they then had to take  the advice of the scientists in how to  control it and I think the government  did do exactly what they were asked we  will learn later on exactly what was  said to them and what they did burn on  my belief is from talking to ministers  they followed the scientific and medical  advice from start to finish and now we  must plan for a moment when we can start  moving out and get the economy so that  it is working again otherwise the damage  will be enormous okay as I said in my  introduction you were once the leader  the Conservative Party if you had once  upon a time been the prime minister  would you have missed five Cobra  meetings after the alarm bells had been  raised well Cobra is a set of letters  standing for Cabinet Office briefing  room a Cobra meetings take place all the  time most of them are functional and  planning meetings when I was in cabinet  the Prime Minister did not attend every  single planning to attend the cobra  meeting in the grips of a global  emergency I would expect him to have  delegated to those relevant secretaries  of state to run those areas that were  meeting in the Cobra room the key point  here is the Prime Minister attends when  it needs all of those departments to be  pulled together for a particular  function I believe he did that the key  element is each of the secretaries of  state working together is responsible  one of them normally takes a lead at a  meeting like that when it's planning so  that's a health lead then they will have  all the other relevant sections of state  around the table and they will take the  lead on it the Prime Minister comes in  when it requires an executive decision  about something which has up till then  not being decided so it 