t out plan to  get the economy moving in a three-phase  process once we've got this under  control that's the critical bit we  should be talking to the public saying  there is a way out of this here is how  it is and let's trust them to understand  the difference between a lockdown  measure and the fact that at some point  will be coming out that's the critical  question and the also the critical  question is that we don't know exactly  how long it is before the restrictions  are going to be completed lifted but the  key question for us is at what point do  we think it's going to be okay to be  able to start moving the economy back  out and I think if you look at the other  countries that are doing it they're  doing it at about the level of half peak  of those who are arriving in hospitals  etc that may be a target figure but the  government will have to figure that out  and the medical advice but the key bit  is let's say  what the plan will be so the public  businesses and others can start to plan  when we move out they'll know how it'll  be done

